- Fix: decouple retries from the turn limit. either (a) reuse a stable per-turn idempotency key and let the server overwrite/retry a failed/reserved attempt, or (b) track completed turns separately and allow more than 2 total attempts (e.g., cap attempts at 2 * successful-targets + retries, or only count completed turns toward the 2-check limit).

